 "chunks": [
  {
   "text": "Stuck on a beach",
   "w0": 0,
   "w1": 3,
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 1.251
  },
  {
   "text": "with only one tree,",
   "w0": 4,
   "w1": 7,
   "start": 1.251,
   "end": 2.315
  },
  {
   "text": "you'd sit under it.",
   "w0": 8,
   "w1": 11,
   "start": 2.515,
   "end": 3.579
  },
  {
   "text": "Don't.",
   "w0": 12,
   "w1": 12,
   "start": 4.079,
   "end": 4.291
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a manchineel.",
   "w0": 13,
   "w1": 15,
   "start": 4.791,
   "end": 5.855
  },
  {
   "text": "It has small green apples,",
   "w0": 16,
   "w1": 20,
   "start": 6.355,
   "end": 7.632
  },
  {
   "text": "and a red band",
   "w0": 21,
   "w1": 24,
   "start": 7.832,
   "end": 8.683
  },
  {
   "text": "someone painted on the trunk.",
   "w0": 25,
   "w1": 29,
   "start": 8.683,
   "end": 10.172
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's what that band is for.",
   "w0": 30,
   "w1": 35,
   "start": 10.672,
   "end": 11.949
  },
  {
   "text": "A storm hits,",
   "w0": 36,
   "w1": 38,
   "start": 12.449,
   "end": 13.087
  },
  {
   "text": "so you shelter under the leaves.",
   "w0": 39,
   "w1": 44,
   "start": 13.287,
   "end": 14.989
  },
  {
   "text": "Each one holds a milky sap,",
   "w0": 45,
   "w1": 50,
   "start": 15.489,
   "end": 16.979
  },
  {
   "text": "and the rain drips it",
   "w0": 51,
   "w1": 55,
   "start": 17.179,
   "end": 18.243
  },
  {
   "text": "onto your skin.",
   "w0": 56,
   "w1": 58,
   "start": 18.243,
   "end": 19.094
  },
  {
   "text": "Soon you're covered in blisters.",
   "w0": 59,
   "w1": 63,
   "start": 19.594,
   "end": 21.296
  },
  {
   "text": "The next day you're starving,",
   "w0": 64,
   "w1": 68,
   "start": 21.796,
   "end": 23.072
  },
  {
   "text": "and the apples smell good.",
   "w0": 69,
   "w1": 73,
   "start": 23.272,
   "end": 24.549
  },
  {
   "text": "One bite is sweet,",
   "w0": 74,
   "w1": 77,
   "start": 25.049,
   "end": 25.9
  },
  {
   "text": "for a second.",
   "w0": 78,
   "w1": 80,
   "start": 26.1,
   "end": 26.951
  },
  {
   "text": "Then your throat burns",
   "w0": 81,
   "w1": 84,
   "start": 27.451,
   "end": 28.302
  },
  {
   "text": "and tightens.",
   "w0": 85,
   "w1": 86,
   "start": 28.302,
   "end": 28.94
  },
  {
   "text": "In Spanish, that fruit is",
   "w0": 87,
   "w1": 91,
   "start": 29.44,
   "end": 30.917
  },
  {
   "text": "the little apple of death.",
   "w0": 92,
   "w1": 96,
   "start": 30.917,
   "end": 32.194
  },
  {
   "text": "Later, nature calls,",
   "w0": 97,
   "w1": 99,
   "start": 32.694,
   "end": 33.957
  },
  {
   "text": "and you grab a handful",
   "w0": 100,
   "w1": 104,
   "start": 34.157,
   "end": 35.434
  },
  {
   "text": "of soft leaves.",
   "w0": 105,
   "w1": 107,
   "start": 35.434,
   "end": 36.072
  },
  {
   "text": "Same sap, same blisters,",
   "w0": 108,
   "w1": 111,
   "start": 36.572,
   "end": 37.836
  },
  {
   "text": "much worse place.",
   "w0": 112,
   "w1": 114,
   "start": 38.036,
   "end": 38.674
  },
  {
   "text": "That night you're cold,",
   "w0": 115,
   "w1": 118,
   "start": 39.174,
   "end": 40.026
  },
  {
   "text": "so you light its wood.",
   "w0": 119,
   "w1": 123,
   "start": 40.226,
   "end": 41.289
  },
  {
   "text": "The smoke stings your eyes",
   "w0": 124,
   "w1": 128,
   "start": 41.789,
   "end": 42.853
  },
  {
   "text": "until you can barely see.",
   "w0": 129,
   "w1": 133,
   "start": 42.853,
   "end": 44.343
  },
  {
   "text": "Next time,",
   "w0": 134,
   "w1": 135,
   "start": 44.843,
   "end": 45.268
  },
  {
   "text": "just sit in the sand.",
   "w0": 136,
   "w1": 140,
   "start": 45.468,
   "end": 46.532
  },
  {
   "text": "Subscribe for more",
   "w0": 141,
   "w1": 143,
   "start": 47.032,
   "end": 47.883
  },
  {
   "text": "of nature's warnings.",
   "w0": 144,
   "w1": 146,
   "start": 47.883,
   "end": 48.947
  }
 ],
 "sentences": [
  {
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 3.579,
   "text": "Stuck on a beach with only one tree, you'd sit under it."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.079,
   "end": 4.291,
   "text": "Don't."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.791,
   "end": 5.855,
   "text": "It's a manchineel."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.355,
   "end": 10.172,
   "text": "It has small green apples, and a red band someone painted on the trunk."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.672,
   "end": 11.949,
   "text": "Here's what that band is for."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.449,
   "end": 14.989,
   "text": "A storm hits, so you shelter under the leaves."
  },
  {
   "start": 15.489,
   "end": 19.094,
   "text": "Each one holds a milky sap, and the rain drips it onto your skin."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.594,
   "end": 21.296,
   "text": "Soon you're covered in blisters."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.796,
   "end": 24.549,
   "text": "The next day you're starving, and the apples smell good."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.049,
   "end": 26.951,
   "text": "One bite is sweet, for a second."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.451,
   "end": 28.94,
   "text": "Then your throat burns and tightens."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.44,
   "end": 32.194,
   "text": "In Spanish, that fruit is the little apple of death."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.694,
   "end": 36.072,
   "text": "Later, nature calls, and you grab a handful of soft leaves."
  },
  {
   "start": 36.572,
   "end": 38.674,
   "text": "Same sap, same blisters, much worse place."
  },
  {
   "start": 39.174,
   "end": 41.289,
   "text": "That night you're cold, so you light its wood."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.789,
   "end": 44.343,
   "text": "The smoke stings your eyes until you can barely see."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.843,
   "end": 46.532,
   "text": "Next time, just sit in the sand."
  },
  {
